                    <SolidColorBrush x:Key="Workspace.CaptionCloseEdge">#C42B1C</SolidColorBrush>
                    <!-- UX review 2026-11-13 (Light list 4, 7, 12, 13, 14, 15): Semi's translucent greys and its blue left in Light.
                         Disabled text is opaque Workspace.Muted instead of 35 % black (2.11:1 on Panel; Muted is 6.66:1; disabled stays WCAG-exempt
                         but readable). Radio buttons follow the checkbox overrides above: unchecked ring in the interactive outline (#726858, 4.64:1
                         on Panel, the Workspace.ControlBorder value of the hover-contrast pass), checked and hover states in the accent tones.
                         Expander text, chevron and rule, the menu/command/date separators (8 % black, 1.16:1) and the one settings slider use palette
                         values; separators and the slider ticks are the decorative border (#948A7D, 2.88:1), the slider track is ProgressTrack. -->
